# Project conventions

## Feature-based layout

```
src/
  app/                 # shell only (App.tsx)
  features/<name>/     # one folder per product feature
    ui/                # feature screens & presentational components
    hooks/
    model/             # types + reducers / domain state
    lib/               # feature-private pure logic (e.g. json/)
    worker/
    constants/
    utils/
    index.ts           # public feature API
  shared/              # cross-feature only (asriui facade, providers)
```

- Do not put feature types, constants, or JSON logic in `shared/`.
- Import another feature only through its `features/<name>/index.ts` export.

## UI (AsriUI)

- Use `@/shared/asriui` for components; `asriui/style.css` in `main.tsx`.
- `shared/providers` wraps `AsriUIProvider` and theme context.

## Imports

- Prefer `@/` alias; within a feature prefer relative imports (`../model/types`).
